#.  FAQ
#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_1_title"
msgid "I want to change what fields are visible at contacts. Can I do it?"
msgstr ""
"தொடர்புகளில் என்ன புலங்கள் தெரியும் என்பதை மாற்ற விரும்புகிறேன். நான் அதை "
"செய்ய முடியுமா?"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "faq_1_text"
msgid ""
"Yes, all you have to do is go in Settings -> Manage shown contact fields. "
"There you can select what fields should be visible. Some of them are even "
"disabled by default, so you might find some new ones there."
msgstr ""
